OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOn the
OL,6,Fcloudy side, with the odd spot of
OL,7,Frain. Some fog forming in developing
OL,8,Fclear spells, especially in western
OL,9,Fparts. Chilly by dawn, with a small
OL,10,Fchance of isolated pockets of grass
OL,11,Ffrost in the most prone rural spots.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSunday:FA murky start for many,
OL,14,Fespecially in the west as areas of
OL,15,Fmist and fog gradually lift. Eventual
OL,16,Fsunny spells possible generally. Light
OL,17,Fwinds and near-average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
